<title>USA: Aeltus named advisor at Merrimac fund.</title>
<headline>Aeltus named advisor at Merrimac fund.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aeltus Investment Management Inc said it was chosen as sub-advisor for the Merrimac Treasury Fund.</p>
<p>Aeltus said Jeanne Wong-Boehm will be portfolio manager.</p>
<p>Aeltus has about $38 billion in assets under management.</p>
</text>
